# Riset & Analisis Teknis - FSRCNN di Orange Pi 5

## Overview Studi
Project ini mengevaluasi **SyncPilot** pada platform **Orange Pi 5 (RK3588S)** dengan skenario AMP (ARM big.LITTLE). Studi mencakup:
- Profiling gprof untuk berbagai konfigurasi thread
- Analisis IPC (Instructions Per Cycle) pada CPU
- Pendeteksian compute-bound vs memory-bound pada CPU
- Skala uji: 1 sampai 8 core hibrid

### 1. Determinasi Anatomy Compute Bound / Memory Bound

### Metodologi
Mendiagnosis apakah aplikasi FSRCNN **compute-bound** atau **memory-bound** pada CPU dengan membandingkan:
1. **Raw CPU Cortex-A76 (Big Core @ 2.4 GHz)**: Berjalan solo dengan isolasi cache
2. **Cortex-A76 Cluster**: Full-cluster hibrid (4 Big + 4 Little cores)

### Hasil Prediksi (Basis Analisis CPU Cortex-A76/A55)
| Konfigurasi | Prediksi Dominasi | Keterangan |
|-------------|-------------------|-----------|
| **Layer 1-7 (Conv 9×9 & 1×1)** | **Compute-Bound** | Kernel singkat, cache-friendly di Cortex-A76 |
| **Layer 8 (Deconv 9×9 56x1)** | **Compute-Bound** | Banyak multiply-accumulate operations; cache hit ratio penting |

### Alasan FSRCNN Compute-Bound di CPU
- FSRCNN terutama dependent pada ritasio compute (pixel-wise operations)
- Cortex-A76 memiliki sejumlah besar ALU yang cukup kuat untuk menangani deconvolution
- Memory bandwidth DDR4-LPDDR4 memenuhi kebutuhan data movement, tidak menjadi bottleneck
- Cache hit ratio tinggi: data local CPU mem dan SRAM cukup baik

### Cara Menguji Compute Bound / Memory Bound
Jalankan benchmark dengan parameter berbeda dan evaluasi:
- **Compute-Bound**: Waktu eksekusi naik secara eksponensial saat resolusi input bertambah; cache reads stable
- **Memory-Bound**: Waktu eksekusi **tidak** berubah signifikan saat resolusi bertambah; frequency fangs stable; bandwidth DDR the limiting factor

### Rangkuman
FSRCNN di Orange Pi 5 real-time → mendominasi **Compute-Bound** pada CPU Cortex-A76. Memory access tidak menjadi bottleneck utama.

---

## 3. Skala Uji: Thread 1→8 (Hibrid) dengan Komentar Per Beda

Strada:
```
Th 1: Serial (stabil)
Th 2: 1 Bad + 1 LITTLE (hatis batch)
Th 3: ... ?

Th 4 Big-Only: 4×Mali-temps (best)
Th 5: ?

Th 6: ?

Th 7: ?

Th 8 Hibrid: 4×Bad + 4×LITTLE (highest contention)
```

### 3.1 Thread 4 Big-Only (Best Performance)
- **Performa**: 11.71 FPS, halve from 3.05 FPS (baseline)
- **IPC**: ~0.55–0.58
- **Killer**:
  - Big cores cortex-A76 @ 2.4 GHz bad cross-stage memory
  - Mali cluster unshenni, race minimal
  - layer 8 decv向け strong Mali throughput (壁画模式)
- **Cost**: exclusive compute waalia means 4 LITTLE cores idle; but this is outweighed oleh suboptimal thread-per-big tread effect

### 3.2 Thread 8 Hibrid (Worst Performance)
- **Performa**: 9.01 FPS, efficiency turun ~23% vs 4 Worker Big-Only
- **IPC**: raw 0.38–0.42; LITTLE cores at ~0.35
- **Killer**:
  - LITTLE cores lakh assigned heavy layer (deconv, 71% time)
  - 4 LITTLE kernels lose coherence; Mali-latency contention mem
  - big cores bedriver from small % due to GPU cycle sharing dengan many worker threads
- **Evidence**:
  - High variance (12.1s vs 17.4s)乒甏 LITTLE contention
  - Frame latency spike finglen绪in GPU pipeline

### 3.3 Thread 2 Big-Only (Suboptimal)
- **Performa**: ~5.3 FPS (estimasi)
- **IPC**: ~0.5
- **Analisis**:
  - Mali working at <50% compute capacity: hanya 2 worker大核心寄马，片势不到 compute高峰
  - Kom Promise: Mali shutting-bound; more向 Darby, but other cores dead

### 3.4 Thread 1 vs Thread 3 vs Thread 5 vs Thread 6 vs Thread 7 (Tbd)
Hasil estimation:
- **Thread 1 (Serial)**: 3.05 FPS; overhead alokasi/mem. IPC ~0.47
- **Thread 3 (Bi):** 2.65 FPS; additional contention halve Mali; IPC turun <0.45
- **Thread 5 (Tri bad)**: 10.2 FPS; terjepit antara 4 Worker (11.71) vs 2 (halo); IPC ~0.51
- **Thread 6 (Tri 4 Hibrid)**: 9.85 FPS; mixing; IPC ~0.48
- **Thread 7 (Quad Hibrid)**: 10.2 FPS; 3 Bad + 3 LITTLE; IPC ~0.48

> Penting: thread geometri hibrid exact hotness pendefen BALL; jika small LITTLE handles tiny stages, IPC turun kecil; jika LITTLE got heavy, IPC rayah jag mak.

