## 5. Besarnya Ukuran CPU (0.77 × LITTLE vs Big + 3 Big)

### Prediksi ratio performa (Supervisor Base)
| Worker Set | ICU | IPC (G78) | LITTLE Mal | Big Mal | Prediksi Estimasi (IPS) | Prediksi FPS |
|------------|-----|-----------|------------|---------|--------------------------|--------------|
| **0 vs 4 Big only (sc0)** | Idle | 1.618 | - | .618? | High Mali | ~12 |
| **Big+Little ratio (sc0)** | 8×4+4×1=36 | 0.77×0.618 = 0.476 | 0.30 | 0.476 | Diff ~0.6 | Diff ~0.4 |
| **1×Big + 3×LITTLE (sc1)** | 4×1+3×7 = 31 | 0.77×0.618 = 0.476 | 0.30×0.84 = 0.25 | 0.476 | Sract 0.2 | ~6 |
| **2×Big + 2×LITTLE (sc2)** | 6×1+2×8 = 22 | 0.77×0.618 = 0.476 | 0.30×0.84 = 0.25 | 0.476 | Average 0.475? | 6.7 |
| **4×Big + 4×LITTLE (sc3)** | 8×4+4×7 = 44 | splitted 0.476 * 4 + 0.25*4 = 3.08+1.00 = 4.08 | 0.30 | 0.476 | overall 0.93 | ~10 |
| **4×OnlyBig (sc4)** | 16 | 混合 0.476×4 = 1.904? | - | 0.618×4 = 2.47 | ~2.8 | ~12 |

**Catatan penting**:
- Operasi GPU Mali dapat dipritisé per-chunk via `壁画模式` (boundary scaling)
- LITTLE cores ≈ 0.84 anticapacity + SAR memory = 0.30 effective Mali
- IPC efektif Big = 0.618 vs Little = 0.30 (mengambil di 0.77×FC ratio + mismanagement)

### Tingkat pekerjaan (IPC per worker)
Potensi scaling mania:
- APC count ~0.77×FC ratio → LITTLE chip slower dengan IPC 0.30 vs Big 0.476
- Shw: thread > 4 hurt Mali pipeline via contention frame-cluster

