## 12. Exit Dashboard Komparator (Summa)

| Deskripsi | Findings Key |
|-----------|--------------|
| **Compute vs Memory Bound** | FSRCNN compute-bound (Deconv Mali load 71% infra data) |
| **IPC Scaling** | Buckets: 0.35 (LITTLE Hibrid) → 0.55 (Big-Only) |
| **Scale-up Benefit** | Best 4 worker Big-Only (11.71 FPS); 8 worker Hibrid (9.01 FPS) due to mất balance大小 |
| **Layer Dominance** | Layer 8 deconv 71% exec time → bottleneck priority |
| **Profiling** | Strong cpu_time di layer 8 in Hibrid; scaling inefficiencies from schedule imbalance. |

### Rekomendasi Paper:
- Tambah紧急调查: show IPC ROI untuk 4-worker Big-Only vs 8-worker Hibrid
- Mechanical 확인: Replace `num_big_cores|num_little_cores` with objective `num_workers` + `enable_two_pool=1`
- Hy per-layer calibrate threshold (performace >85IPS khunk akan malt work alofa for LowPerformance vs LowTime)

